    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d497">

                <pb facs="0619" n="539" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg539"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hill to Mr. Russell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-05-22"><hi rendition="#italic">May 22,
                        1901.</hi></date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 415.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    No. 605, of the 3d instant, inclosing a copy of the note addressed by the
                    president of the State of Barcelona to the United States consular agent at
                    Barcelona apologizing for the latter’s arrest, also a copy of Mr. Balz’s
                    reply.</p>
                <p>The Department awaits your reply to its No. 414, of the 4th instant, which
                    crossed your dispatch, relative to an expected explanation of the failure to
                    deliver the legation’s telegram to the consular agent.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">David J. Hill</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
